{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["In the chariot of the second — a horse or mule designated for the man who is second to the king to ride upon, which belongs to him." "Avrech — he is a father to the king, as we say: לא רכא ולא בר רכא, that is: a father to the king. And this is the force of וישימני לאב לפרעה, for פרעה is a term for king, as I explained above — a father, a minister, for the needs of the king."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:59.189029339Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}